---
import ServiceLayout from '../../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';
import { href } from '../../lib/urls';
---
<ServiceLayout
  title="Housekeeping Maid Malaysia | Live-in Domestic Helper | Final Choice"
  description="Hire a live-in housekeeping maid in Malaysia for cleaning, laundry, ironing and cooking. Final Choice matches Indonesian and Filipino helpers to your home’s needs."
  path="/services/housekeeping-maid/"
  h1="Housekeeping maid for your home"
  eyebrow="Housekeeping helper"
  lead="A live-in domestic helper to keep your home clean and organised: cleaning, laundry, ironing and help in the kitchen, arranged around your family’s routine."
  serviceName="Housekeeping maid"
  skill="housekeeping"
  need="Housekeeping"
  related={[
    { label: 'What happens after your maid arrives', path: '/blog/what-happens-after-your-maid-arrives-in-malaysia/' },
    { label: 'How to hire a maid in Malaysia', path: '/blog/how-to-hire-a-maid-in-malaysia/' },
    { label: 'Maid packages', path: '/maid-packages/' },
  ]}
>
  <h2>Typical housekeeping duties</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Daily cleaning of living areas, bedrooms, bathrooms and kitchen</li>
    <li>Laundry, ironing and folding</li>
    <li>Washing dishes and keeping the kitchen tidy</li>
    <li>Preparing simple family meals, or more, depending on cooking experience</li>
    <li>Watering plants and light care of the home’s surroundings</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    A domestic helper works in your home only, as a live-in helper under her employment contract. If your family also needs
    childcare or elderly care, tell us — the right candidate for a mixed role may be different from one focused only on housekeeping.
  </p>

  <h2>Setting clear expectations</h2>
  <p>
    Most misunderstandings come from unclear expectations. We recommend writing a simple daily and weekly schedule before your
    helper arrives, showing her how you like things done in the first weeks, and agreeing on rest times and the rest day as set
    out in her contract. See <a href={href('/blog/what-happens-after-your-maid-arrives-in-malaysia/')}>what happens after your maid arrives</a> for a practical first-month guide.
  </p>

  <h2>Cooking</h2>
  <p>
    Cooking ability varies widely. Some candidates are confident with Malaysian, Chinese or Indian home-style dishes; others
    are willing to learn. Each profile on our <a href={href('/maids/')}>maid directory</a> shows whether a candidate has
    cooking experience, and you can ask about the dishes she has prepared during the interview.
  </p>
</ServiceLayout>
